{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Pomegranates.</b> They were round and hollow, in the shape of pomegranates made like a hen's egg." "<b>And golden bells.</b> Grape-clusters with bells inside them." "<b>Among them all around.</b> Between them, all around — between two pomegranates, one bell attached and suspended at the hem of the robe."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:19.161474099Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}